# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# 🛡️ Sentinel: never commit real secrets. Env files hold the Supabase keys,
# the Postgres DATABASE_URL and SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET. `*.local` above only
# catches `.env.local`, leaving `.env`/`.env.production`/etc. exposed to an
# accidental `git add .`. Ignore all env files but keep the secret-free template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

